---
import MascotMark from './MascotMark.astro';
---
<aside class="right-rail hidden xl:block" aria-label="About the community">
  <div class="sticky top-5 space-y-3">
    <section class="rail-card rail-card--accent">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="mascot-bubble"><MascotMark class="h-10 w-10" /></span><div><p class="eyebrow">Today’s mood</p><h2 class="text-base font-black">Mildly inconvenienced</h2></div></div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-5 text-ink-muted">The feed is made from development fixtures. Your local interactions disappear on refresh.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="rail-card" aria-labelledby="types-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pick your problem</p><h2 id="types-heading" class="mt-1 text-base font-black">Four flavours of oversharing</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li><strong>Confessions</strong><span>Things that escaped your inner monologue.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Petty Court</strong><span>Minor crimes. Major opinions.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Am I Weird?</strong><span>Peer review for suspicious habits.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Hot Takes</strong><span>Opinions served warmer than necessary.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="rail-card">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-black">House rules, briefly</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-xs leading-5 text-ink-muted"><li>Be funny without being cruel.</li><li>Keep private information private.</li><li>Disagree without becoming the problem.</li></ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</aside>
